              </p>
              <p>
                However, this guide evaluates these paths purely as <strong>generational economic engines</strong>. From an equity standpoint, government jobs offer zero inheritance of authority, brand, or client infrastructure. You trade long-term equity for lifetime security and short-term prestige.
              </p>
            </div>
          </details>

