              <span class="faq-toggle">➕</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="faq-body">
              <p>
                You don't need to force an unnatural fit. But before walking away from an established family enterprise, recognize its real market value. Building a functioning business, an active client roster, and an industry reputation from scratch takes decades.
              </p>
              <p>
                If you choose a different path, make sure you enter a field that offers its own compounding equity—not a linear, start-from-scratch role that leaves your own children at ground zero.
              </p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
