                Because of cultural lag. A generation ago, public sector employment was the only reliable path to stability and social respect. Many parents still project that outdated playbook onto their children.
              </p>
              <p>
                Today, that reliance often locks capable young minds into years of exam preparation, missing out on prime compounding years in the modern economy.
